Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gamepi <archie2x@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gamepi-amdgpu (= 0.1.0), gamepi-kiosk (= 0.2.0), gamepi-remote-input (= 0.1.0), gamepi-controllers (= 0.1.0)
Description: Gamepi Raspberry Pi 5 gaming appliance
 Installs the tested GPU/kernel setup, frontend, emulators and kiosk session.
 ROMs, BIOS images, user saves and Bluetooth pairing state are separate.
